{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"823","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"2019財報 五大天王出爐","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">2020-04-01 &nbsp;01:01 &nbsp;經濟日報/記者張瀞文/台北報導</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/2019%E8%B2%A1%E5%A0%B1%E4%BA%94%E5%A4%A9%E7%8E%8B.JPG\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">圖／經濟日報提供</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">上市櫃公司2019年財報昨（31）日公布，五大天王出爐，台積電穩坐獲利王寶座、鴻海蟬聯現金王、大立光仍然為每股純益（EPS）王，力旺、M31是毛利率王，嘉威則成為獲利成長王。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">台積電2019年稅後純益3,453.4億元，傲視群雄，但比2018年略減1.6%，每股純益13.32元，歷史次高。台積電去年獲利遙遙領先，是上市櫃公司整體獲利第二名鴻海1,153億元的近三倍。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">特別的是，受美中貿易戰衝擊，台塑四寶及大型電子股獲利都減少，排名隨之下滑，金控股崛起。去年獲利第三到第十名依次為國泰金、富邦金、中信金、台塑、台塑化、台化、中華電、兆豐金。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">現金王方面，鴻海現金及約當現金部位達8,578.6億元，仍是現金部位最多的上市櫃公司；台積電帳上現金也有4,553億元，為第二名。國泰金以4,134億元擠進第三，再來是富邦金及新光金。現金部位前十大公司中，金融股占一半，為過去罕見的現象。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">股王大立光同樣蟬聯EPS王，2019年全年每股賺210.69元，再度刷寫新猷，並大幅領先其他上市櫃公司，主要受惠於蘋果多鏡頭趨勢，而且也打進非蘋陣營。另外，伺服器大廠緯穎去年EPS達36.42元，雖低於2018年的38元，但仍是EPS亞軍。譜瑞-KY及環球晶去年的EPS都超過31元，分列三、四名。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">力旺持續為毛利王，這家矽智財（IP）廠的營運模式以收取權利金為主，營收有七成來自於權利金收入，其餘為技術服務，毛利率高達100%，長期待在毛利王寶座。同為100%毛利率的公司還有同為矽智財業者的M31，以及台微體、浩鼎、高端疫苗等生技醫療股。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">嘉威轉型有成，拿下2019年獲利成長王，純益比前一年大增684倍、達2.17億元。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); display: block; box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源: https://udn.com/news/story/7251/4459847</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-04-01","clk_count":"225"}},"__N_SSG":true}